<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya kwanja kwa Paulo kwa Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Vat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya kwanja lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa lya kwanja kwa Vatesalonike ikasimbilwe na Mnjagila Paulo musula lya kwanja. Iyi ivecha nde baluwa lya kwanja yeisimbilwe na Paulo na kuvikwa mu Bibiliya, iyi ikasimbilwe kumwaka va hamusini na yimwi peababilwe Yesu Kilisito. Paulo akali akwikala ku Kolinito peakaisimbile baluwa lya kwanja kwa vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito va Tesalonike, vanu avo vevamdikie Kilisito veakali avavangiche chipindi kya lugendo lwake lwa uvili lwa kudalika Njowo Nofu, Magito 17.1-10. Isimbilwe mukiganulo kya Magito kuva lipinga lya vadikila va Kilisito livangiche na vamonga va Vayawudi na Vayunani volofu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo seakasigalie ukoya ku Tesalonike kwa chipindi cholofu peakali avagiche lipinga lya vanu vevamdikie Kilisito, ndena akasimbile baluwa iyi neke kuvanamacha lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito vevakali ukoya. Baluwa iyi ihumilila njowo chongofu chongofu, kagi yiwulanicha malagicho molofu gyegiwulanicha peving'ang'wa lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito kwikala. Paulo alongile hilo kuwuya kwa Yesu Kilisito. Ivecha kuva lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito vevikalile ku Tesalonike vakeliswe hilo na mawulanicho agyo. Paulo igumbanikila mawulanicho gya kuwuya kwa Yesu Kilisito ngita ng'asi lya kuvagita vikale kwa kumkelesa Nguluvi, Magito 5.6-8.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe mukiganulo kya kwanja kya Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo avangile kusimba baluwa iyi kwa kuvahugila vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito na kumhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva lyao, Vatesalonike va kwanja 1.1</para>
  <para style="io">Baho ehumulila njowo cheagitile kwa avo vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito Vatesalonike va kwanja musula lya 2-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele Paulo ihumulila namuna peikuvang'ang'a lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito kwikala kuno vakikolela uhuvilo vawo mpaka peiwuya Yesu, Vatesalonike va kwanja musula lya 4.1—5.15.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo imalila baluwa lyake kwa kuvahungila kangi lipinga lya vadikila, na kulagicha kila munu mugati lya lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito ing'ang'wa akwimbe, Vatesalonike va kwanja musula lya 5.16-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Nene Paulo pamwi na Silivanusi na Timotewo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Tuvasimbiye baluwa iyi nyenye lipinga lya vanu ukoya ku Tesalonike vemumdikie Kilisito, mukali vanu vake Daada vetu Nguluvi na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Tukuvang'ang'ila usangi na lutengamaso.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwikala na kwidikila kwa Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tukumuhongecha Nguluvi figono fyonda kwa jili lya nyenye na tukuvaviwuka mukulumba kwa nefwe. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Twigita ndena, kwakuva pautalo lya Nguluvi Daada vetu, twikwiwuka pemuwonisile kwidikila kwa magito na ukelo venu peukuvatanga kugita kasi kwa kugangamala na luhuvilo lwenu kwa Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Vakololo vetu, twichela kuva Nguluvi akuvakela na kuva avahaguwe muveche vanu vake. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Kwakuva petukavadalikiye Njowo Nofu sechikali njowo hela, ila kwa ludali na Muhe va Nguluvi, ndakyene njowo ichi chikali ndakyene. Mwichela petukakalile pamwi na nyenye, tukalile ndeni kwa kuvatanga nyenye. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Nyenye mukayiwulaniche kuhuma kwa nefwe na kwiwulanicha kuhuma kwa Mtwa, ata pemkagudile hilo mukauwanuke unanzi uwo kwa lukeduko lweluhumila na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ndena nyenye muvechile uwano mnofu kwa vanu vonda vadikila va ukoya ku Mekedoniya na Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Kwakuva kuhuma kwa nyenye vanu vapulikile Njowo Nofu se vanu va ukoya ku Mekedoniya na Akaya hela, kangi ata kumwidikila Nguluvi kulutie kila pono, ndena setung'ang'wa kulonga hilo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Vanu avo vakila pono vilonga pemkatuwanuke na pemkalekile kulumba fing'omong'omo na kumsedukila Nguluvi yeagehe wumi na vandakyene, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />nondee mukumchindila Mwana vake yeikwacha kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi yani Yesu, yeachulubuchwe na Nguluvi kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe na yeakutulowa muluvipo lwa Nguluvi weukwacha.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kasi lya Paulo ukoya ku Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Lukololo vetu, nyenye mwavene mwichela kuva kuvagendela kwa nefwe kwa nyenye seikali hela. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Mwichela kuva tukagudilwe na kuligwa ukoya Filipi petukali twave kufika kwa nyenye Tesalonike. Ingava tukapatile upinjani mkomi, ila Nguluvi akatugaviye ukakatima va kudalika Njowo Nofu lyake. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Njowo chetudalike kwa nyenye sechikali njowo cha udesi awu kwa unjanganifu, vala setusaka kumchanga munu yeyonda, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />ila nefwe twilonga ngita peikela Nguluvi, kwakuva mwene atuidikiye nefwe na akatugaviye ichi Njowo Nofu. Setusaka kuvakelesa vanu haa, ila twisaka kumkelesa Nguluvi yeichela numbula chetu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Kangi mwichela kuva setukachile kwa nyenye kwa njowo cha kuvagita mutukele vala setukatumiye njowo ichi kwifiya unenga tunga, Nguluvi yumwene ndi mswida vetu! <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Setukasakile njuma kuhuma kwa vanu, vala kuhuma kwa nyenye, vala kuhuma kwa munu yeyonda yula, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />ata ngita tukali vanjagila va Kilisito, tukali na ludali lwa kutumila umwimike vetu kusaka finu kuhuma kwa nyenye, ila nefwe tukali vayigafu mugati lyenu ngita maye peakuvalela vana vake. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Kwakuva tukavakeliye hilo nyenye ata kuvagavila Njowo Nofu lya Nguluvi, ila ndeni ndeni kugita makani gyetu gyonda gyakuvatanga nyenye, kwakuva mukali vaganja vetu! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Lukololo vetu, nyenye mwikwiwuka petukagitile kasi kwa kugangamala hilo. Petukavaletiye Njowo Nofu cha Nguluvi tukagitile kasi pamunyi na pamiye neke tubihile kuva mchigo kwa munu yeyonda pagati penu.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Nyenye mwivesa kuva vaswida vetu pamwi na Nguluvi, kuva magito gyetu pagati lyenu nyenye yemumdikiye Kilisito ukali mnofu na vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi bila mang'ung'unilo. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Mwichela petukali tukimgitila kila munu, ngita daada peakuvagitila vana vake yumwene. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Tukavagangamicha na tukavanamacha, neke mubihile kuleka kugita ngita peikela Nguluvi, mwene yeakuvakemela mwingile mu ung'achale na mu ukomi vake.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Kangi tukumhongecha Nguluvi figono fyonda, kwakuva pemkali mwipulikicha luchowo lwake kuhuma kwa nefwe, semkawanuke ngita luchowo lwa munu, ila mukawanuke ngita luchowo lwa Nguluvi na undakyene ilyo nde luchowo lwa Nguluvi. Kwakuva Nguluvi igita kasi pagati penu nyenye yemumdikiye Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Vakololo vangu, nyenye muhumilwe na makani chichila gegavahumie lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Yudeya, yeva Kilisito Yesu. Nyenye mkagudile ndeni ndeni kuhuma kwa vanu venu vavene ngita vadikila avo pevagudisilwe na Vayawudi, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />avo vakamdochile Mtwa Yesu na vavichi va Nguluvi, vakatugudisile na nefwe kangi. Vanu avo vakumvipisa Nguluvi, kangi ndi vachindwama va kila munu, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />kwakuva vakagechile kutukanila kuvadalikila vanu se Vayawudi unanzi daukuvaletela ulowa. Ndena viginicha topu sambi, ila nondee Nguluvi avavipiye na dakuvahiga nongwa.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo eng'ang'a kuvagendelela kangi Vatesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Vakololo vangu, kulekana kwa nefwe na nyenye kukali kwa chipindi hela, kangi kulekana kuno kukali kwa mvili hela na se kwa numbula. Chipindi chonda ichi, tukali twidoboka kutang'ana na nyenye. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ndena tung'ang'ile kuvagendelela kangi. Nene Paulo ndikagechile kwacha kwa nyenye mala chongofu, ila Setani akatukaniye. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Kwa undakyene nyenye hela nde mukutugita nefwe tuveche na luhuvilo na lukeduko na kwinjuma pautalo lya Mtwa vetu Yesu, chipindi peikwacha. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ndakyene nyenye ndi unjuma vetu na lukeduko lwetu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Pambele tukalemwile kuchindila hilo. Suwe, tukalamuwe tusigale ukoya Atene weka hela, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />na kumlagicha kwa nyenye lukololo vetu Timotewo, mnyigedwa muyetu kuva dalikila Njowo Nofu cha Kilisito, ache kuvagangamicha na kuvatanga muwidikilo venu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />tukagitile ndena, neke munu yeyonda abihile kulemwa kwakuva lya magudo aga. Nyenye mwichela kuva tung'ang'wa kupatila magudo. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ndakyene petukali pamwi na nyenye, tukali tukuvalongela kuva tugudiswa, ngita pemchela, ndeni peituhumiye. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ndena ndikalamuwe kumlagicha Timotewo kwa nyenye. Sendawesile kuhuvilila hilo, ndena ndikamlagiche neke ndipate njowo cha kwidikila kwa nyenye. Ndaogwipe na ndikahochile kuva kwa ng'asi tunga yula Setani avagechile na kuvagwisa na kasi yonda yetukagitele mugati lyenu iyagile hela!<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Timotewo awuyile, atugaviye njowo cha kukedusa pakyanya lya kwidikila na usanzi venu. Atulongiye kuva kila kigono mkutukwiwuka kwa lukeduko, kangi mwidoboka kutulola nefwe, ngita ndeni nefwe petudoboka kuvalola nyenye. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nodee, lukololo vangu, njowo cha kwidikila kwa nyenye, chitunamachile muutatala na mumagudo gyetu gyonda, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Kwakuva nondee tukwikala mu undakyene petukuvalola nyenye mugangamala kwakuva pamwi na Mtwa. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Twiwesa kumhongecha Nguluvi kwajili lyenu. Kwakuva tugehe na lukeduko hilo pautalo lya Nguluvi kwajili lya nyenye. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Tugina kumsuka Nguluvi pamiye na mamunyi kwa numbula chenu chonda neke atutage twache kangi kwa nyenye tuvahogechele kyekipwemusilwe muudikilo venu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Tukumulumba Nguluvi yeagehe Daada vetu na Mtwa vetu Yesu, aveche pamwi na nefwe petukwacha kwa nyenye. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Mtwa avatange nyenye mukelane hilo na kuvakela vanu vonda, ngita nefwe petukuvakela nyenye. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Kangi tukumsuka Nguluvi avagangamaliche numbula chenu, neke muveche vanu vemdikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi Daada vetu, chipindi Mtwa Yesu daikwacha pamwi na vanu vake vevadikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kwikala kwa kumkelesa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Nondee vakololo vangu, mwiwulaniche kuhuma kwa nefwe pemng'ang'wa kwikala neke mumkelese Nguluvi. Ndakyene mvechile mukwikala ndeni. Nondee tukuvasuka kwa litawa lya Mtwa Yesu mugine kugita manofu. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Kwakuva mukugachele gala malagicho getukavagaviye kwa umwimike lya Mtwa Yesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Nguluvi ekung'ang'a nyenye muveche mwidikilwe pautalo lyake na muleke ugoni. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Kila munu achele kutavala muvili vake yumwene kwa ung'alile na uginyange, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />na mbihile kwikala kwa ludoboko luhafu ngita vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Kwa njowo iyi munu yeyonda abihile kumgitila nogwa lukololo vake vala kumchanga. Ngita petukavalakalile kuva, Mtwa dakuvahiga nogwa vevigita njowo icho. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Kwakuva Nguluvi seakatukemeliye twikale mu ugoni, ila tukale kwa kumkelesa Mwene. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nondee, munu yeyonda yeakugabeda mawulanicho aga seakumbeda munu, ila akumbeda Nguluvi yumwene yeakuvagavila Muhe vake.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Nondee, setung'ang'wa kangi kuvasimbila nyenye njowo cha kuvakela lukololo venu vevadikiye. Nyenye muwulanichwe na Nguluvi yumwene pemng'ang'wa kukelana. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Muveche mukivagitila ndena vakololo vetu vonda vevadikiye kila pono ukoya Mekadoniya. Ndeni vakololo vangu, tukuvasuka mugite ndeni hilo. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Muveche vanu va kwikala kwa lutengamaso, kila munu agite njowo chake yumwene na agita kasi kwa miwoko gyake yumwene ngita petuvalongiye pamwandi. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Baho muvecha mwonise magito manofu kwa vala sevamdikiye Kilisito, kangi semuvecha vanu va kumuhuvila munu yeyonda.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa Mtwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Vakololo vetu, twikela mchele undakyene va vala vevafuwe, neke mbihile kusugwima ngita vanu vangi vevihela uhuvilo. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Nefwe, twichela kuva Yesu afuwe, kangi akachulubuke na ndeni nefwe twikwidikila kuva Nguluvi akuvaleta pamwi na Yesu vala vonda vevafuwe kuno vadikiye.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Aga gyetukuvalongiya ndi mawulanicho gya Mtwa, kuva nefwe vetugehe uwumi vetuvecha tusigaliye chipindi Mtwa peikwacha, ndakyene setukuvalongola vala vevakali vafuwe. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Kwakuva Mtwa yumwene akwika kuhuma kuluhano na umwimike mkomi na lichwi lya ndumindumi va Nguluvi mkomi yapulika, ata lichwi lya lipembe lya Nguluvi lipulikika. Ndeni vala vevafuwe kuno vakimdikila Kilisito vekwika tandi. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Baho nefwe vetugehe uwumi chipindi icho twikong'aswa pamwi navo mulifunde kutang'ana na Mtwa kuluhano. Ndena tuvecha tukwikala pamwi na Mtwa figono fyonda. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Nondee muveche mwinamachana kwa machowo icho.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Mwiyandalise kigono kya kuwuya kwa Mtwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Vakololo vangu, setuvesa kuvasimbila nyenye, chipindi na muda va kuwuya kwa Mtwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Kwakuva nyenye mwichela kwa undakyene kigono kya kuwuya kwa Mtwa kikwacha ngita muhichi peikwacha pamiye. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Vanu pevivecha vilonga, “Tugehe na lutengamaso, kangi kugehe unofu,” Chipindi icho nde uhanangifu peukuvachiya bahobaho! Njowo icho chihumila bahobaho ngita uvafi weukumpata maye chipindi kya kubaba, vala vanu davayepa hamu. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ila nyenye lukololo vangu, semgehe mukisi na kigono ikyo sekikuvachila bahobaho ngita peikwacha muhichi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Nyenye vonda ndi vanu yemwikwikala mu welu, vanu va pamunyi. Nefwe se vanu va pamiye, vala se vanu va kisi. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ndena, tubihile kugona tulo ngita vanu vangi, tung'ang'wa tuveche meho na twiyandalise. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Kwakuva vevigona vigona pamiye na vagala vigala pamiye. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ila nefwe ndi vanu va pamunyi tung'ang'wa twiyandalise kwa kufwala udikilo na lukelo ngita mwenda va kyuma va kwidimila pakihafu na tuveche na luhuvilo lwa ulowa lwetu litudime ngita kofila lya fita. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Kwakuva Nguluvi seakatuhanguwe neke tudochwe kwa luvipo lwake, ila Nguluvi akatuhaguwe tuveche na ulowa mu Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />yeafuwe kwajili lyetu, neke twikale pamwi na mwene, petugehe uwumi awu petufuwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ndena, mwinamache na kwitanga mwavene, ngita pemgita nondee.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilicho gya kumalila na ungilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Vakololo vetu, tukuvasuka muvaginye vala vevigita kasi mugati lyenu, vala vevakuvalongocha na kuvawulanicha namuna lya kwikala kwa kumdikila Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Muvaginye hilo na kuvakela kwakuva lya kasi yevigita. Muveche na lutengamaso pagati penu.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Vakololo vetu tukuvalongela muvakane vanu vevagehe vagata, muvanamache vanu vevatwinwike, muvatange vanu vasosuvafu, muveche na luhuvilo kwa vanu vonda. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Mulole unofu munu yeyonda abihile kumpilusila muyage mawofu. Ila figono fyonda mwigitile usanzi nyenye kwa nyenye na kwa vanu vonda.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Mukeduke figono fyonda, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />mlumbe chipindi chonda, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />mhongeche Nguluvi kwa fyonda, kwakuva ago nde ekela muveche mukigagita kwa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Mbihile kumkanila Muhe va Nguluvi, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />mbihile kubeda uvichi va Nguluvi, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ila mugeche finu fyonda, mukolele chechigehe unofu, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />na muveche patali na unjanangifu vonda.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nguluvi yumwene yeakutugavila lutengamaso, avadikiye vanu voda. Achilolele numbula chenu na kwikala kwa nyenye na mivili gyenu na finu fyonda vivikwe ngajila nongwa mpaka chipindi cha kwacha Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Nguluvi yeavakemeliye nyenye dakuvagitila aga. Kwakuva mwene ndi va undakyene. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Vakololo vangu, mulumbile na nefwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Muvahungile vakololo vonda kwa luhungilo lwa lukelo.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ndikuvasuka kwa litawa lya Mtwa muvakwimbile baluwa iyi vakololo vetu vonda.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Tukuvang'ang'ila usangi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>